OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'I never enjoyed exercise at school as
OL,4,AI was bullied' says DJ, ahead of
OL,5,A400-mile bike feat
OL,6,
OL,7,FEvans, 42, who is originally from
OL,8,FAmmanford, Carmarthenshire, begins his
OL,9,Fchallenge in Scotland on Monday, 9
OL,10,FNovember, concluding the 643km feat in
OL,11,Fthe Welsh capital on 13 November.
OL,13,F"Mentally, for me, it's been a
OL,14,Fchallenge," said Evans. "Hopefully I'm
OL,15,Fgoing to inspire people to do exercise
OL,16,Fand realise that you can do this; you
OL,17,Fdon't have to write off exercise
OL,18,Fforever."
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
